<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#dpa_3_1_3m_ft_variant> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasParameterNumber> "3268838"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "YAML model_params is 3268838." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.01686.pdf> .
