<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto-individuals#multitask_pretraining_openlam_v1> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto#usesLoss> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto-individuals#mse> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "Table S-9 lists the loss function as MSE for DPA-3.1-3M training." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.01686.pdf> .
