<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto-individuals#finetuning_mptrj_salex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fine-tuning of the pretrained DPA-3.1-3M model on MPtrj and sAlex datasets to align the XC functional for improved performance on inorganic materials benchmarks such as Matbench Discovery."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "PDF Section 2.5 describes the fine-tuning procedure and results on Matbench Discovery benchmark (Table S-7)." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.01686.pdf> .
